{
  "_implementation_notes": [
    "CRIMSON CITY -- Maps 119, 167, 168, 169, 170, 176, 177, 523, 805.",
    "Crimson City is a tiny, remote town north of Route 10. It barely",
    "appears on maps. Giovanni retreats here to meditate after his",
    "defeat -- two variants by switches.",
    "",
    "Map 119 (PokeMart): ALL shelf events ('shelves are filled with",
    "Pokemon goods!') are MECHANICAL shop decor -- preserved exactly.",
    "EV024 (Level Ball description) is MECHANICAL -- preserved.",
    "",
    "Map 167 (Crimson City overworld): Giovanni meditation encounter",
    "has TWO variants:",
    "  EV011 (page 0, switch 10 + self_switch A): Pre-endgame Giovanni",
    "    retreating to reflect. NOT reformed. Still bitter, still certain",
    "    he was right. Returns to Viridian for final confrontation.",
    "  EV029 (page 0, switch 918 + switch 18): Post-endgame Giovanni",
    "    in an alternate context -- this version shows a different frame.",
    "  EV010 (switch 325): Giovanni departure scene with Rocket grunts.",
    "  EV012/EV013 (switch 324): Grunt dialogue after Giovanni leaves.",
    "TYPE_EXPERT_STEEL (EV039) post-battle is flavor -- rewritten.",
    "EV033 (Pokemon cry) is MECHANICAL -- preserved for page 0.",
    "  Page 1 (switch 1009): band quest -- MECHANICAL, preserved.",
    "EV035-37 (drumsets) are flavor -- rewritten.",
    "EV009 is town NPC flavor -- rewritten.",
    "",
    "Maps 168-170 (Crimson City houses):",
    "  168: EV005 (Cresselia quest echo, switches 1026+var 282) is",
    "    MECHANICAL -- preserved. EV004 is scientist NPC -- flavor intro",
    "    rewritten, DNA Splicers mechanics preserved.",
    "  169: EV005 NPC flavor rewritten. EV004 NPC flavor rewritten.",
    "    EV006 (cupboard 'empty') flavor. EV008/009 (TV) flavor.",
    "  170: EV005/006 (TV) flavor. EV007 Dratini trade is MECHANICAL --",
    "    preserved. EV009 Pokemon cry MECHANICAL. EV004 (cupboard).",
    "",
    "Map 176 (Crimson Hotel): EV005 hotel desk is MECHANICAL lodging.",
    "  EV013 salon intro, EV014 hairdresser are MECHANICAL.",
    "  EV010 Mankey Paw buyer is MECHANICAL trade -- preserved.",
    "",
    "Map 177 (Crimson Hotel rooms): EV005 Shellder quest MECHANICAL.",
    "  EV011 waterfall NPC quest MECHANICAL. EV007 empty cupboard flavor.",
    "  EV008 Ghost/Normal type quest MECHANICAL. EV009 trainer+Synthesis",
    "  tutor MECHANICAL. EV010 Pokemon cry MECHANICAL.",
    "",
    "Maps 523/805 (Waterfall Cave): Pokemon cries MECHANICAL.",
    "",
    "Line length limit: ~42 characters per line for RPG Maker XP."
  ],
  "maps": {
    "167": {
      "name": "Crimson City",
      "events": {
        "11": {
          "name": "Giovanni",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": { "switch1_id": 10, "self_switch": "A" },
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 6,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\PN..."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 8,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I did not expect company.",
                    "Certainly not yours."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 10,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I came here to think. Not",
                    "to reflect -- I have nothing",
                    "to reflect on."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 12,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "We had a vision for Kanto.",
                    "A real one. You kept getting",
                    "in the way.",
                    "That's what children do."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 16,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "So -- you came looking for",
                    "Viridian City's Gym Leader?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 20,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "It is indeed me. Always",
                    "has been."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 27,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Fine. I'll return to",
                    "Viridian. I'll give you",
                    "your eighth badge."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 30,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I may not have the birds",
                    "or Mewtwo at my side.",
                    "I never needed them."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 35,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "We will see each other",
                    "soon, \\PN. And you will",
                    "learn what conviction",
                    "looks like."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "29": {
          "name": "",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": { "switch1_id": 918, "switch2_id": 18 },
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "You again. I did not expect",
                    "to be found here."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 3,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I came here to think about",
                    "everything I've done.",
                    "The decisions. The cost."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 6,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "There are things I regret.",
                    "Not the goal -- the methods.",
                    "Some of them."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 9,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I can only try to be better",
                    "from here. That's what",
                    "people say, isn't it?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 12,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I have more free time now.",
                    "If you want a battle, I'll",
                    "be at the Fighting Arena",
                    "in Vermilion."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 15,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I'll wait for you there.",
                    "If you come."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "10": {
          "name": "EV010",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": { "switch1_id": 325 },
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "As you know, the operation",
                    "has taken... considerable",
                    "losses."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 4,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I must retreat. Spend time",
                    "with my family. Consider",
                    "what comes next."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 7,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Do not follow me. Do not",
                    "attempt contact. I will",
                    "reach out when I'm ready."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 10,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I will be the one to",
                    "decide when the time is",
                    "right."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 13,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Yes boss!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 15,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Of course."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 18,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Very well. Farewell."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "12": {
          "name": "EV012",
          "pages": {
            "1": {
              "conditions": { "switch1_id": 324 },
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "The boss went back to his",
                    "family. Somewhere in Johto.",
                    "He needs time."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 4,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Don't even think about",
                    "following him."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "13": {
          "name": "EV013",
          "pages": {
            "1": {
              "conditions": { "switch1_id": 324 },
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "His family lives somewhere",
                    "in Johto. That's all I",
                    "know. That's all anyone",
                    "should know."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "39": {
          "name": "TYPE_EXPERT_STEEL",
          "pages": {
            "1": {
              "conditions": { "self_switch": "A" },
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Steel bends. Apparently",
                    "so do I. Well fought."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "35": {
          "name": "EV035",
          "pages": {
